\ Not supported yet (Forth review of small-tactics-1, finding 1; plan FE3):
\ the statement's decide True needs a Decidable True, which d, a local
\ instance, gives in Lean; pinned Lean then refuses the proof ("Tactic
\ `rfl` failed": decide True with d does not reduce). Before the fix
\ LeanForth took instDecidableTrue and accepted the text; now error 139
\ at end, where the statement is elaborated.
\ Lean: theorem u_ii_statement (d : Decidable True) : decide True = true := by rfl
theorem u_ii_statement
  True Decidable explicit: d  True Decidable.decide Bool.true =
:= by
  by-rfl
end u_ii_statement
